"在“文件”菜单导出事件 JSON 作为备份，导入会添加未存在的事件。遇到同一事件的不同版本会保留当前数据并说明冲突。保存含新功能的数据后，旧版应用可能无法读取，请使用当前版本。" = "Use the File menu to export event JSON as a backup. Import adds events that are not already present. Conflicting versions of one event preserve current data and report the conflict. Data saved with newer features may not open in older apps; use the current version.";
"在事件右键菜单置顶，置顶事件始终排在前面。使用“显示”菜单按日期或创建时间排序，默认按日期；应用会记住选择。" = "Use an event’s context menu to pin it. Pinned events always appear first. The View menu sorts by date or creation time; the default is date. The app remembers your choice.";
"在桌面右键选择“编辑小组件”，添加日距的小号或中号组件。自动选择优先考虑置顶与最近日子，也可指定一个事件。每个组件可分别开关“显示事件图标”“显示目标日期”“显示当天精确计时”；全天事件不显示精确计时。" = "Right-click the desktop and choose Edit Widgets to add a small or medium DayDistance widget. Automatic selection prioritizes pinned and nearby events; you can also select a specific event. Each widget has separate controls for its icon, target date and same-day timer. All-day events do not show a precise timer.";
"在系统设置的“通知”中检查日距权限，以及专注模式等系统设置。允许通知后，重新保存需要提醒的事件。诊断检查不会请求或更改权限。" = "Check DayDistance in System Settings → Notifications, as well as Focus and other system settings. After allowing notifications, save events that need reminders again. Diagnostic checks do not request or change permission.";
