"请先打开日距，确认事件数据可以读取，再运行快捷指令。" = "Open DayDistance and confirm its data can be read before running this shortcut.";
"日距正在编辑事件或显示对话框。请先保存或取消，再运行快捷指令。" = "DayDistance has an editor or dialog open. Save or cancel it before running this shortcut.";
"事件标识无法识别。请在快捷指令中重新选择事件。" = "The event identifier is invalid. Select the event again in Shortcuts.";
"创建日距事件" = "Create DayDistance Event";
"创建一个新事件并返回事件标识。通知默认关闭；编辑或对话框打开时不会创建。" = "Create an event and return its identifier. Reminders are off. No event is created while an editor or dialog is open.";
"查询日距天数" = "Get DayDistance Days";
"读取指定事件的天数。结果为非负整数，摘要区分还有与已过；归档或删除的事件不会替换为其他事件。" = "Read the selected event’s day count. The result is nonnegative and the summary distinguishes remaining and elapsed days. Archived or deleted events are never replaced by other events.";
"打开日距事件" = "Open DayDistance Event";
"在日距中打开指定事件。不会保存事件或覆盖正在编辑的草稿。" = "Open the selected event in DayDistance without saving it or replacing an existing draft.";
"已创建：%@" = "Created: %@";
"已打开：%@" = "Opened: %@";
"%@ · %@" = "%@ · %@";
"在编辑窗口的“更多选项”选择天数、周 / 天或年 / 月 / 天。周年只用于每年重复的事件。年份与月份按实际日历计算，默认仍显示天数。" = "Choose Days, Weeks / days, or Years / months / days in More Options. Anniversary is available for yearly events. Years and months follow the calendar; Days remains the default.";
"固定中号事件" = "Fixed Medium Events";
"编辑中号小组件，开启“中号手动选择事件”，按第一、第二、第三槽位选择最多三个事件。重复选择只显示一次；归档或删除后该槽位显示不可用，不会替换为其他事件。小号仍使用原来的事件选择。" = "Edit a medium widget, enable manual selection, and choose up to three events in slot order. Duplicate choices appear once. Archived or deleted events show an unavailable slot instead of another event. Small widgets keep their original selection.";
"快捷指令" = "Shortcuts";
"在系统“快捷指令”中添加日距的创建事件、查询天数或打开事件动作。查询返回非负天数，摘要区分还有与已过。创建默认不提醒；编辑或文件面板打开时，创建和打开动作会暂停并提示。" = "In Shortcuts, add an action to create an event, get its day count, or open it. Queries return a nonnegative day count and distinguish remaining from elapsed days. Creation starts with reminders off. Close editing or file dialogs before creating or opening an event.";
"复制与分享" = "Copy and Share";
"在事件右键菜单复制摘要，或打开“分享图片”预览。可以隐藏目标日期，再用系统面板保存 PNG。图片只保存到你选择的位置，不会自动发送。" = "Use the event context menu to copy its summary or preview a share image. Hide the target date if desired, then save a PNG using the system panel. The image stays at your chosen location and is never sent automatically.";
