"Vim 与多选" = "Vim and Multiple Selection";
"事件列表中：j/k 上下，gg/G 首尾，/ 搜索，v 连续选择，Space 切换单项，Esc 结束选择，i 编辑，o 新建，dd 移到回收站，u 撤销，Ctrl-r 重做。文本输入和弹窗内不拦截。设置中可关闭 Vim 键位。" = "In the event list: j/k move, gg/G jump to first/last, / searches, v selects a range, Space toggles one item, Esc ends range selection, i edits, o creates, dd moves to Trash, u undoes and Ctrl-r redoes. Text inputs and dialogs keep normal typing. Disable Vim Keys in Settings.";
"使用 ⌘/⇧ 多选，右键批量归档、移到回收站或恢复。⌘⇧A 归档，⌘⇧R 恢复；每次批量操作可一次撤销。⌘D 复制为新事件，先打开草稿且默认关闭提醒，取消不保存。" = "Use Command/Shift to select multiple events, then archive, move to Trash or restore from the context menu. Command-Shift-A archives and Command-Shift-R restores. A batch operation is undone together. Command-D duplicates into a new draft with reminders off; canceling saves nothing.";
"自定义提醒" = "Custom Reminders";
"提醒可选自定义，设置提前 0–365 天及时间。提前天数按日历计算。编辑窗口显示保存后的预计时间；设置显示通知权限及系统中已安排的下一条提醒。权限只在保存启用提醒时申请。" = "Choose Custom to set 0–365 calendar days before the event and a time. The editor shows an estimated reminder after saving. Settings shows notification permission and the next reminder scheduled with the system. Permission is requested only when saving an enabled reminder.";
