"仅在本机补排每日、满月和周年通知；关闭后已安排的通知仍会发送，覆盖日期之后需重新打开应用。" = "Renews daily and anniversary notifications on this Mac only. Scheduled notifications still arrive after disabling; reopen the app before their coverage ends.";
